units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam
pair_coeff 1 1 /scratch/gilbreth/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt2.potential
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.001
reset_timestep 0
velocity all create 600.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp press pe ke etotal vol
thermo_modify norm no flush yes
fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 2500.0 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
run 10
